David,

With DEC OSF/1 V1.2 the development environment is a separate layered 
product beyond the base OS.  Although it is included on the DEC OSF/1 consolidated CD-ROM, the license must be purchased separately to use any 
portion of the Developer's kit.  Within the DEC OSF/1 Developer's Kit the license just happens to be enforced by a check in dbx.

For more information, look in the /pub/DEC/DECinfo/DECnews-UNIX directory
or gatekeeper.dec.com for:

