|> > Has anyone else seen this? Does anyone have a fix? We don't have a copy of
|> > the Motif 1.2 source, so I can't find and apply the patches myself.


This problem happens only when you use cxx. To fix it, you have to use cxx with
the option -DNO_XMSTRINGS.
You can see the reasons in the file /usr/include/cxx/Xm/Xm.h with the definition
of the macro X_GBLS(str,off). 


