This problem should be fixed for the next release of DEC OSF/1.  In the mean
time, you may be able to get this to work.  First, make sure you have the
"Comma Key Sends ,," option enabled in the DECterm Keyboard Options dialog
box (this option is badly named - it actually affects both the comma and
period keys).  Second, make sure your keyboard map matches your keyboard
(look in the Customize Keyboard dialog box of the Session Manager).  If
this still doesn't work for you, please feel free to send me mail with a
detailed configuration description, and we'll work something out.

